+| Database | PostgreSQL 16 + PostGIS 3.4 |
+| Cache | Redis 7 |
+| Storage | MinIO |
+| Monitoring | Prometheus + Grafana |
+| Logging | Loki (или ELK) |
+| Errors | Sentry |
